is entity id generator creates linearly incrementing entity ids","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unless an entity is marked as unused then the marked id is returned next in a FIFO order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with an increased generation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The slot index 0 is reserved and never provided; slots start at generation 0. A slot whose generation reaches ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt32.max"},{"text":" is retired and never provided again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Furthermore it respects order of entity ids on initialization, meaning the provided ids on initialization will be provided in order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until all are in use. After that the free entities start at the lowest available id increasing linearly skipping already in-use entity ids.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"},"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Linear incrementing entity id generator","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifierGenerator","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/Se","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/SE","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityCreated","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\